                                "sense_id": "c60a9df7-2ba0-36c9-931d-4e6912487bcc",
                                "text": "Before embarking on her trip, Kaefer expected to find a pan-Antarctic vocabulary, but quickly discovered there were distinct colloquialisms within each station."
